<node>
    <node name="description" channel="inline" format="text/plain" model="An integer with a size of just one byte.

The standard type used internally is unsigned char with 8 Bits.
It has a value range from 0 to 255.

Caution! It is not to be mixed up with &#x0022;application/octet-stream&#x0022;.
Numbers in an array are separated by comma; bytes of a stream are not."/>
